      { "@type": "Question", "name": "How much does an emergency plumber cost in Woolton?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "£80 an hour weekdays 9am to 5pm. £120 an hour weekends 9am to 1pm. £150 an hour out of hours, nights and bank holidays. 1 hour minimum on every call-out. Parts at cost. Most jobs cost £80 to £350. Written quote before work starts. No separate call-out fee." } },
