      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Can you find a hidden leak without opening walls?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, in most cases. We carry heat-camera kit that spots temperature differences behind walls and under floors. This pinpoints the source of a hidden leak before any plaster is opened. We always try non-invasive leak finding first. Call 0151 558 0334." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Do you cover larger detached homes with multi-zone heating?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. The detached homes on Hillside Drive, Baroncroft Road and the wider Woolton area often have two or three heating zones, mains pressure cylinders feeding several bathrooms, and top-brand fittings. We're G3 trained for unvented work and know Hansgrohe, Grohe, Villeroy & Boch and the other big brands." } },
