          <p>Built from local Woolton sandstone. Solid walls, original features, often Grade II listed. The plumbing has been changed many times over 150 years. We work around the original cornicing, fireplaces and floorboards.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>Period Terraces in Woolton Village</h3>
          <p>Church Road, Vale Road, Quarry Street. Three-bed mid-terraces with period character. Original lead and cast iron in places. We carry the right parts on the van.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>Listed and Heritage Zone Properties</h3>
          <p>The Woolton Conservation Area covers much of the village. Beaconsfield Road and Church Road have Grade II listings. We plan work to keep the heritage features safe. We give you the paperwork you need for listed building consent.</p>
