      <h2>Common Emergency Jobs in Woolton</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">What we attend most often in L25.</p>
      <div class="jobs-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">

        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Hidden Leaks in Large Detached Homes</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Water on the kitchen ceiling. The source could be any of three bathrooms above. We use a heat camera to find the pipe before we touch the plaster. Standard kit on every Woolton call-out.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Multi-Zone Heating Failures</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Large Woolton homes often have two or three heating zones, several motorised valves and split controls. More parts means more things that can break. We work out the fault before swapping anything. The wrong call on a big system is costly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Unvented Cylinder Faults</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Mains pressure cylinders feed several bathrooms in a detached home. When the immersion or controls fail, the whole house loses hot water. We're G3 trained and carry common spares.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Top-Brand Fixture Repairs</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Hansgrohe, Grohe, Villeroy & Boch, Crosswater. The big brands in Woolton bathrooms have set cartridge sizes and part numbers. We carry the common ones and know where to find the rest fast.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Period Property Drain Issues</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Long clay drain runs under large Woolton gardens. Tree roots breaking in. Ground moving and cracking the pipe. Both common in older homes. We run a CCTV survey if it keeps blocking. We clear it with high-pressure jetting.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Boiler Breakdowns in Heritage Zone Homes</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Listed and heritage homes often have boilers in awkward spots. The flue location was set by the council at install time. We work out the fault and fix it without changing the original layout.</p>
        </div>
